  "content": "<center>\n\n![超可愛材質包標題](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ohS9Jkb7/images/5aa33b607d16d767cd5bb4383839bf4cfef4a549.jpeg)\n\n<center><span><strong><font size=\"5\">超可愛材質包</font></strong>\n<p></p>\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/super-cute\">\n  <img alt=\"Modrinth\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/super-cute\">\n  <img alt=\"CurseForge\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/BrandonItaly/LCE-Resources\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/github-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/BrandonItaly\">\n  <img alt=\"GitHub贊助\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/ghsponsors-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/brandonitaly\">\n  <img alt=\"Ko-fi\" height=\"56\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<p></p>\n\n超可愛材質包讓你能創造一個充滿最萌、最療癒生物的世界！彈跳的兔兔、超萌獨角獸、閃亮蜜蜂，還有……呃，漢堡？沒錯，就是漢堡！連魷魚都能讓你尖叫「好可愛」！\n<p></p>\n\n這個材質包為方塊、物品、實體和介面加入了超可愛的紋理。\n<p></p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>預覽</summary>\n\n![世界預覽](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ohS9Jkb7/images/f62fee0ce9deacef7efd0e948ea4387f27fe90c9.png)\n\n![材質對比](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/ohS9Jkb7/images/db92579b431eb81ea3edcf2855f50515dc041490.png)\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>更多資源包</summary>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th align=\"center\">圖標</th>\n      <th>名稱</th>\n      <th>下載次數</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n  <tr><td><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/meEXwbr9/770e36a855375d291ea82a6cb093a9340b5e38cc.png\" width=\"64\